# A 70/30 first split followed by even splits: 35, 35, 15 and 15 percent.
# Uneven splits are how an array gets a tapered illumination and lower side lobes.

title 1x4 tree with uneven first split
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 21

comp s1 splitter ratio=0.7
comp s2 splitter
comp s3 splitter
link s1.2 s2.1
link s1.3 s3.1
port in s1.1
port out1 s2.2
port out2 s2.3
port out3 s3.2
port out4 s3.3

expect level out1 1.55 -4.55931956 1e-6
expect level out2 1.55 -4.55931956 1e-6
expect level out3 1.55 -8.23908741 1e-6
expect level out4 1.55 -8.23908741 1e-6
expect passive
